{"step_index":3668,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-29T10:21:32Z","thinking":"**Refining Aesthetics**\n\nI'm currently focused on aligning the `sovereign_orbs.html` page with the Antigravity chat's strict corporate/minimalist design. The goal is dark mode with a sleek `#1E1E1E` background and `#2D2D2D` message bubbles. I'm aiming for a sparse, clean visual that matches the chat's aesthetic. I need to achieve this minimalist goal by rewriting the styling rules.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>XORAS — Command & Control</title>\n    <style>\n        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap');\n\n        :root {\n            --bg-base: #0E0E11;\n            --bg-panel: #16161A;\n            --bg-input: #1C1C21;\n            --border: #2A2A35;\n            --text-main: #E2E2E9;\n            --text-dim: #8B8B9C;\n            --accent: #E2E2E9;\n            --font-ui: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;\n            --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n        }\n\n        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n        body, html {\n            width: 100vw; height: 100vh; overflow: hidden;\n            background: var(--bg-base);\n            font-family: var(--font-ui);\n            color: var(--text-main);\n            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n        }\n\n        /* === LAYOUT === */\n        .app {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 400px;\n            height: 100vh;\n        }\n\n        /* === VISUALIZATION STAGE === */\n        .stage {\n            position: relative;\n            border-right: 1px solid var(--border);\n            display: flex; flex-direction: column;\n        }\n        \n        .stage-header {\n            position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;\n            padding: 24px 32px;\n            display: flex; justify-content: space-between;\n            z-index: 10; pointer-events: none;\n        }\n        .brand {\n            font-weight: 500; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 2px;\n            color: var(--text-dim); text-transform: uppercase;\n        }\n        .telemetry-tag {\n            font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px;\n            color: var(--text-dim);\n        }\n\n        canvas {\n            position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0;\n            width: 100%; height: 100%;\n        }\n\n        .agent-status-bar {\n            position: absolute; bottom: 32px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);\n            display: flex; gap: 40px; z-index: 10;\n        }\n        .agent-metric {\n            display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\n        }\n        .agent-metric-val {\n            font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-dim);\n        }\n        .agent-metric-name {\n            font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 1px;\n            text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-main);\n        }\n\n        /* === CHAT INTERFACE (IDE TIER) === */\n        .chat {\n            display: flex; flex-direction: column;\n            background: var(--bg-panel);\n        }\n        \n        .chat-header {\n            padding: 20px 24px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\n        }\n        .chat-title {\n            font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;\n        }\n        .chat-status {\n            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\n            font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-dim);\n        }\n        .status-dot {\n            width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%;\n            background: #4ADE80; box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(74,222,128,0.4);\n        }\n\n        .messages {\n            flex: 1; overflow-y: auto;\n            padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px;\n        }\n        \n        .msg {\n            display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\n        }\n        .msg-meta {\n            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;\n        }\n        .msg-sender {\n            font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;\n        }\n        .msg-time {\n            font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-dim);\n        }\n        .msg-content {\n            font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: #C8C8D0;\n            white-space: pre-wrap;\n        }\n        \n        .msg.user .msg-sender { color: #A0A0AB; }\n        .msg.agent .msg-sender { color: var(--text-main); }\n        .msg.agent .msg-content { color: var(--text-main); }\n\n        .input-area {\n            padding: 20px 24px;\n            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n        }\n        .input-box {\n            display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 12px;\n            background: var(--bg-input);\n            border: 1px solid var(--border);\n            border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 16px;\n            transition: border-color 0.2s;\n        }\n        .input-box:focus-within { border-color: #404050; }\n        \n        textarea {\n            flex: 1; background: transparent; border: none; outline: none;\n            color: var(--text-main); font-family: var(--font-ui);\n            font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.5; resize: none;\n            min-height: 20px; max-height: 150px;\n        }\n        textarea::placeholder { color: #5A5A68; }\n        \n        .send-btn {\n            background: transparent; border: none; cursor: pointer;\n            color: var(--text-dim); padding: 4px;\n            transition: color 0.2s;\n        }\n        .send-btn:hover { color: var(--text-main); }\n        .send-btn svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; fill: currentColor; }\n        \n        /* Subtle thinking indicator */\n        .thinking {\n            display: none; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-dim);\n            font-style: italic; margin-top: -12px; margin-bottom: 12px;\n        }\n        \n        /* Custom Scrollbar */\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #2A2A35; border-radius: 3px; }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #3A3A45; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"app\">\n    <div class=\"stage\">\n        <div class=\"stage-header\">\n            <div class=\"brand\">XORAS System</div>\n            <div class=\"telemetry-tag\" id=\"hashDisplay\">ROOT: —</div>\n        </div>\n        <canvas id=\"glcanvas\"></canvas>\n        <div class=\"agent-status-bar\" id=\"statusBar\"></div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"chat\">\n        <div class=\"chat-header\">\n            <div class=\"chat-title\">Quorum Deliberation</div>\n            <div class=\"chat-status\"><div class=\"status-dot\"></div>Local Inference</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"messages\" id=\"msgs\">\n            <div class=\"msg agent\">\n                <div class=\"msg-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"msg-sender\">System</span>\n                    <span class=\"msg-time\" id=\"initTime\"></span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"msg-content\">Secure connection established. All agents standing by.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"thinking\" id=\"thinking\">Agent is processing...</div>\n        <div class=\"input-area\">\n            <div class=\"input-box\">\n                <textarea id=\"inp\" placeholder=\"Message the collective...\" rows=\"1\"></textarea>\n                <button class=\"send-btn\" id=\"sendBtn\">\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M2.01 21L23 12 2.01 3 2 10l15 2-15 2z\"/></svg>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\ndocument.getElementById('initTime').textContent = new Date().toLocaleTimeString([],{hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit'});\n\n// =========================================================================\n// CORPORATE WEBGL PHYSICS — Minimal, sheer smoke, clinical geometry\n// =========================================================================\nconst gl = document.getElementById('glcanvas').getContext('webgl', { antialias: true, alpha: false });\nlet W, H;\nfunction resize() {\n    const p = gl.canvas.parentElement;\n    W = p.clientWidth; H = p.clientHeight;\n    gl.canvas.width = W * 2; gl.canvas.height = H * 2;\n    gl.canvas.style.width = W + 'px'; gl.canvas.style.height = H + 'px';\n    gl.viewport(0,0, W*2, H*2);\n}\nwindow.addEventListener('resize', resize); resize();\n\nconst vs = `attribute vec2 p; varying vec2 v; uniform vec2 c; uniform float r, a;\n    void main() { v=p; gl_Position = vec4(c + p*r*vec2(1.0/a,1.0), 0, 1); }`;\nconst fs = `precision highp float; varying vec2 v; uniform vec3 col; uniform float g, t, act;\n    void main() {\n        float d = length(v);\n        // Clinical sharp core, sheer volumetric halo\n        float core = smoothstep(0.15, 0.12, d);\n        float halo = exp(-d * 4.5) * 0.4;\n        float smoke = sin(d*20.0 - t*3.0) * 0.02 * (1.0-d);\n        float i = (core + halo + smoke) * g;\n        // Muted monochrome overlay\n        vec3 finalCol = mix(vec3(0.8,0.8,0.9), col, 0.4) * i;\n        finalCol += vec3(1.0)*core*0.5;\n        gl_FragColor = vec4(finalCol, i * 0.8);\n    }`;\nconst lvs = `attribute vec2 p; uniform float a; varying float va; void main(){va=a;gl_Position=vec4(p,0,1);}`;\nconst lfs = `precision highp float; varying float va; void main(){gl_FragColor=vec4(0.5,0.5,0.6,va*0.1);}`;\n\nfunction comp(src, t) { const s=gl.createShader(t); gl.shaderSource(s,src); gl.compileShader(s); return s; }\nconst pOrb = gl.createProgram(); gl.attachShader(pOrb, comp(vs, gl.VERTEX_SHADER)); gl.attachShader(pOrb, comp(fs, gl.FRAGMENT_SHADER)); gl.linkProgram(pOrb);\nconst pLin = gl.createProgram(); gl.attachShader(pLin, comp(lvs, gl.VERTEX_SHADER)); gl.attachShader(pLin, comp(lfs, gl.FRAGMENT_SHADER)); gl.linkProgram(pLin);\n\nconst buf = gl.createBuffer(); gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, buf); gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, new Float32Array([-1,-1,1,-1,-1,1,1,1]), gl.STATIC_DRAW);\nconst lbuf = gl.createBuffer();\n\n// Highly desaturated corporate colors\nconst AGENTS = [\n    { id:'maxx', name:'MAXX', col:[0.5, 0.7, 0.8], x:0, y:0, vx:0, vy:0, a:0, r:0.25, g:1, act:1, lb:Date.now() },\n    { id:'vance', name:'VANCE', col:[0.7, 0.5, 0.5], x:0, y:0, vx:0, vy:0, a:2, r:0.25, g:1, act:1, lb:Date.now() },\n    { id:'eden', name:'EDEN', col:[0.5, 0.7, 0.6], x:0, y:0, vx:0, vy:0, a:4, r:0.25, g:1, act:1, lb:Date.now() },\n    { id:'daxx', name:'DAXX', col:[0.6, 0.6, 0.7], x:0, y:0, vx:0, vy:0, a:6, r:0.25, g:1, act:1, lb:Date.now() }\n];\n\nconst sb = document.getElementById('statusBar');\nAGENTS.forEach(a => {\n    const d = document.createElement('div'); d.className='agent-metric'; d.id='m-'+a.id;\n    d.innerHTML = `<div class=\"agent-metric-val\">IDLE</div><div class=\"agent-metric-name\">${a.name}</div>`;\n    sb.appendChild(d);\n});\n\nlet t0 = performance.now()/1000, lf = t0;\nfunction draw() {\n    requestAnimationFrame(draw);\n    const now = performance.now()/1000, t = now-t0, dt = Math.min(now-lf, 0.05); lf = now;\n    \n    gl.clearColor(0.055, 0.055, 0.066, 1); gl.clear(gl.COLOR_BUFFER_BIT);\n    gl.enable(gl.BLEND); gl.blendFunc(gl.SRC_ALPHA, gl.ONE);\n    \n    // Physics\n    AGENTS.forEach((a, i) => {\n        a.a += dt * 0.1;\n        const act = Math.max(0.1, 1 - (Date.now()-a.lb)/60000);\n        a.act = act; a.g = 0.2 + act*0.8;\n        const tx = Math.cos(a.a)*(a.r + Math.sin(t+i)*0.05);\n        const ty = Math.sin(a.a)*(a.r + Math.cos(t+i)*0.05);\n        a.vx += (tx-a.x)*2.0*dt; a.vy += (ty-a.y)*2.0*dt;\n        a.vx *= 0.9; a.vy *= 0.9;\n        a.x += a.vx*dt; a.y += a.vy*dt;\n        \n        const mel = document.getElementById('m-'+a.id);\n        if(mel) mel.children[0].textContent = act > 0.9 ? 'ACTIVE' : 'IDLE';\n    });\n\n    // Lines\n    gl.useProgram(pLin);\n    for(let i=0;i<AGENTS.length;i++) for(let j=i+1;j<AGENTS.length;j++){\n        const a=AGENTS[i], b=AGENTS[j];\n        gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, lbuf); gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, new Float32Array([a.x,a.y, b.x,b.y]), gl.DYNAMIC_DRAW);\n        const lp=gl.getAttribLocation(pLin,'p'); gl.enableVertexAttribArray(lp); gl.vertexAttribPointer(lp,2,gl.FLOAT,false,0,0);\n        gl.uniform1f(gl.getUniformLocation(pLin,'a'), (a.g+b.g)/2);\n        gl.drawArrays(gl.LINES,0,2);\n    }\n    \n    // Orbs\n    gl.useProgram(pOrb); gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, buf);\n    const op=gl.getAttribLocation(pOrb,'p'); gl.enableVertexAttribArray(op); gl.vertexAttribPointer(op,2,gl.FLOAT,false,0,0);\n    AGENTS.forEach(a => {\n        gl.uniform2f(gl.getUniformLocation(pOrb,'c'), a.x, a.y);\n        gl.uniform1f(gl.getUniformLocation(pOrb,'r'), 0.2);\n        gl.uniform1f(gl.getUniformLocation(pOrb,'a'), W/H);\n        gl.uniform3fv(gl.getUniformLocation(pOrb,'col'), a.col);\n        gl.uniform1f(gl.getUniformLocation(pOrb,'g'), a.g);\n        gl.uniform1f(gl.getUniformLocation(pOrb,'t'), t);\n        gl.drawArrays(gl.TRIANGLE_STRIP,0,4);\n    });\n}\ndraw();\n\n// =========================================================================\n// CHAT LOGIC\n// =========================================================================\nconst msgsEl = document.getElementById('msgs');\nconst inp = document.getElementById('inp');\nlet lastLen = 0;\n\nfunction appendMsg(sender, text) {\n    const d = document.createElement('div');\n    d.className = 'msg ' + (sender === 'user' ? 'user' : 'agent');\n    \n    // Format name mapping\n    let name = sender;\n    if (sender === 'user') name = 'You';\n    else {\n        const ag = AGENTS.find(x => x.id === sender.toLowerCase());\n        if (ag) { name = ag.name; ag.lb = Date.now(); }\n        else name = sender.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + sender.slice(1);\n    }\n\n    d.innerHTML = `\n        <div class=\"msg-meta\">\n            <span class=\"msg-sender\">${name}</span>\n            <span class=\"msg-time\">${new Date().toLocaleTimeString([],{hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit'})}</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"msg-content\">${text.replace(/</g,'&lt;')}</div>\n    `;\n    msgsEl.appendChild(d);\n    msgsEl.scrollTop = msgsEl.scrollHeight;\n}\n\nasync function send() {\n    const v = inp.value.trim();\n    if(!v) return;\n    inp.value = ''; inp.style.height = 'auto';\n    \n    try {\n        await fetch('/api/chat', {\n            method:'POST',\n            headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},\n            body:JSON.stringify({sender:'user', text:v})\n        });\n    } catch(e) {}\n}\n\ndocument.getElementById('sendBtn').onclick = send;\ninp.onkeydown = e => { if(e.key === 'Enter' && !e.shiftKey) { e.preventDefault(); send(); } };\ninp.oninput = () => { inp.style.height = 'auto'; inp.style.height = Math.min(inp.scrollHeight, 150) + 'px'; };\n\nsetInterval(async () => {\n    try {\n        const r = await fetch('/api/chat_history');\n        if(r.ok) {\n            const arr = await r.json();\n            if(arr.length > lastLen) {\n                for(let i=lastLen; i<arr.length; i++) appendMsg(arr[i].sender, arr[i].text);\n                lastLen = arr.length;\n            }\n        }\n    } catch(e) {}\n}, 1000);\n</script>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Sophisticated corporate IDE-tier orb engine. Pitch dark slate backgrounds, sheer desaturated WebGL shaders, geometric grid layout, identical UX to modern code editors. Removed all cartoon/rainbow aesthetics. Contains Maxx, Vance, Eden, and Daxx.","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/Users/ajoxendine68/Desktop/SSOT_Agentic_Brain/ops/scripts/fullscreen_ui/sovereign_orbs.html","toolAction":"Writing IDE-tier sovereign_orbs.html","toolSummary":"Create corporate dark mode UI"}}]}
