{"step_index":3670,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-29T10:22:15Z","thinking":"**Initiating Polling Actions**\n\nI'm now focusing on setting up a polling mechanism. The goal is to either poll `web_chat.json` and send alerts based on new messages or poll `agent_inbox.jsonl`. Alternatively, I can leverage the `schedule` tool to have the conversation wake up.\n\n\n**Implementing Two-Way Sync**\n\nI'm now building a script for two-way synchronization. It will tail the Antigravity transcript, extracting model responses (specifically `PLANNER_RESPONSE` without tool calls) and writing them to `web_chat.json`. Simultaneously, it'll monitor `agent_inbox.jsonl` for user input from the webpage. I'll read this to either write to a scratch file, or send a push notification to trigger a response.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"bash /Users/ajoxendine68/Desktop/SSOT_Agentic_Brain/ops/scripts/agent_speak.sh maxx \"Maxx here. Corporate IDE tier deployed. Pitch dark slate backgrounds, sheer desaturated WebGL smoke shaders, exact replica of your Antigravity chat layout. Daxx is locked to Kokoro neural voice with Lee as fallback.\"","Cwd":"/Users/ajoxendine68/Desktop/SSOT_Agentic_Brain","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Dispatching Maxx speech","toolSummary":"Maxx IDE tier announcement"}}]}
