{"step_index":3697,"source":"USER_EXPLICIT","type":"USER_INPUT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-29T10:28:24Z","content":"<USER_REQUEST>\nCrumbs down to a single input line. Kill any borders or labels that compete with the glow, and let the particles carry the hierarchy. Density + restraint is what sells it. 100 orbs in muted, desaturated tones—slate, steel, one accent color—reads as a control room, not a toy. The comical look comes from bright, saturated colors in big, cartoonish shapes, not from having many of them. So the fix isn't fewer orbs, it's a tighter palette and tighter spacing. That's the right architecture. Instanced rendering, one draw call for all 100,000 small nodes, each a tiny sphere sharing the same geometry, with per-instance color and size passed through attributes. The big agents stay as individual meshes with their own glow and telemetry. The small ones become a field, a living background that pulses when the big agents are active. \n</USER_REQUEST>\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\nThe current local time is: 2026-09-29T06:28:24-04:00.\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>"}
{"step_index":3698,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-29T10:28:24Z","thinking":"**Refining The Chat UI**\n\nI'm currently focused on drastically simplifying the chat UI in `sovereign_orbs.html`. The goal is a single, borderless input line to maximize the visual impact of the glow. All competing elements like borders and labels will be removed, ensuring a clean and unobtrusive user interface.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Visual Elements**\n\nI'm now zeroing in on visual hierarchy and palette. The plan is a \"control room\" aesthetic, favoring muted and desaturated tones like slate and steel, with a single accent color for emphasis. Spacing will be tightened for a more focused presentation. The WebGL engine in `sovereign_orbs.html` is next on the list.\n\n\n**Implementing WebGL2 Features**\n\nI'm now implementing the WebGL2 features in `sovereign_orbs.html`. The UI is nearly complete, and I've stripped it down to a single floating input at the bottom and minimalistic chat messages above. Currently, I'm focusing on the WebGL part, particularly the background field. I will generate a large `Float32Array` of points, aiming for 50,000-100,000 to be rendered. I've decided to go with `gl.drawArraysInstanced` on a tiny quad or triangle for this, in order to keep the rendering strategy as requested.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"bash /Users/ajoxendine68/Desktop/SSOT_Agentic_Brain/ops/scripts/agent_speak.sh vance \"Vance here. Acknowledged. We strip the UI to a single borderless line. We compress the palette to slate and steel with one accent. And we push the architecture: one hundred thousand instanced nodes in a single draw call, forming a living field around the core agents. Pure control room density.\"","Cwd":"/Users/ajoxendine68/Desktop/SSOT_Agentic_Brain","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Dispatching Vance speech","toolSummary":"Vance instancing announcement"}}]}
{"step_index":3699,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"RUNNING","created_at":"2026-09-29T10:28:34Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-29T06:28:34-04:00\nTool is running as a background task with task id: bd892285-cca1-43cd-bb8b-d1c3128f05ca/task-3699\nTask Description: bash /Users/ajoxendine68/Desktop/SSOT_Agentic_Brain/ops/scripts/agent_speak.sh vance \"Vance here. Acknowledged. We strip the UI to a single borderless line. We compress the palette to slate and steel with one accent. And we push the architecture: one hundred thousand instanced nodes in a single draw call, forming a living field around the core agents. Pure control room density.\"\nTask logs are available at: file:///Users/ajoxendine68/.gemini/antigravity/brain/bd892285-cca1-43cd-bb8b-d1c3128f05ca/.system_generated/tasks/task-3699.log"}
{"step_index":3700,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-29T10:28:40Z","thinking":"**Designing the UI**\n\nI'm currently focused on the UI changes for `sovereign_orbs.html`. The `.chat` area is now overlaid directly on the `.stage`, and the `.input-area` is a single, borderless line at the bottom. I'm also implementing a fading effect for the `.messages` area to improve the user experience.\n\n\n**Refining the Shader**\n\nI've been working on refining the WebGL shader for the instanced nodes. The initial version used a 2D projection, but I'm now incorporating a 3D perspective matrix for a more realistic and visually appealing effect. The vertex shader includes animation based on time and instance-specific phase variables, with an organic drift effect. The billboard scale is based on z-depth and the global pulse variable.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"cat << 'EOF' > /tmp/write_orbs_v3.py\nimport os\n\nHTML = \"\"\"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>XORAS — Control Room</title>\n    <style>\n        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@300;400;500&display=swap');\n\n        :root {\n            --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n            --slate: #8A8D98;\n            --steel: #464853;\n            --bg-void: #060608;\n            --accent: #00E5FF;\n        }\n\n        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n        body, html {\n            width: 100vw; height: 100vh; overflow: hidden;\n            background: var(--bg-void);\n            font-family: var(--font-mono);\n            color: var(--slate);\n            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n        }\n\n        canvas {\n            position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0;\n            width: 100%; height: 100%; z-index: 1;\n        }\n\n        /* Overlay UI - Extreme Minimalist */\n        .overlay {\n            position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;\n            z-index: 10; pointer-events: none;\n            display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;\n        }\n\n        /* Top HUD */\n        .hud-top {\n            padding: 24px 32px;\n            display: flex; justify-content: space-between;\n            font-size: 10px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 2px;\n            text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--steel);\n        }\n        \n        .agent-status-bar {\n            display: flex; gap: 32px;\n        }\n        .agent-metric {\n            display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\n        }\n        .agent-metric.active { color: var(--slate); }\n        .agent-metric.active .indicator { color: var(--accent); text-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--accent); }\n\n        /* Chat Stream */\n        .chat-container {\n            position: absolute; bottom: 80px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);\n            width: 600px; max-height: 40vh;\n            display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-end;\n            mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 0%, black 20%);\n            -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 0%, black 20%);\n            overflow: hidden; pointer-events: auto;\n        }\n        .messages {\n            display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;\n            padding: 20px 0; overflow-y: auto;\n            scrollbar-width: none;\n        }\n        .messages::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }\n        \n        .msg {\n            display: flex; gap: 12px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.5;\n            animation: fadein 0.3s ease-out;\n        }\n        @keyframes fadein { from{opacity:0; transform:translateY(8px);} to{opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);} }\n        \n        .msg-sender {\n            width: 60px; text-align: right; font-weight: 500; flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .msg-content { color: #A1A3B0; }\n        .msg.user .msg-sender { color: var(--steel); }\n        .msg.agent .msg-sender { color: var(--accent); text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(0,229,255,0.4); }\n        .msg.agent .msg-content { color: #D1D3E0; }\n\n        /* Input Line - Single Borderless Line */\n        .input-line {\n            position: absolute; bottom: 32px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);\n            width: 600px; pointer-events: auto;\n            display: flex; align-items: center;\n        }\n        .input-prompt {\n            color: var(--accent); font-size: 11px; margin-right: 12px;\n            text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(0,229,255,0.4);\n        }\n        .chat-input {\n            flex: 1; background: transparent; border: none; outline: none;\n            color: #fff; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px;\n            padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--steel);\n            transition: border-color 0.3s;\n        }\n        .chat-input:focus { border-bottom-color: var(--slate); }\n        .chat-input::placeholder { color: var(--steel); }\n\n        .thinking {\n            position: absolute; bottom: 64px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);\n            font-size: 10px; color: var(--steel); font-style: italic;\n            opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s;\n        }\n        .thinking.visible { opacity: 1; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<canvas id=\"glcanvas\"></canvas>\n\n<div class=\"overlay\">\n    <div class=\"hud-top\">\n        <div>XORAS // QUORUM <span id=\"hashDisplay\">ROOT: —</span></div>\n        <div class=\"agent-status-bar\" id=\"statusBar\"></div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"chat-container\">\n        <div class=\"messages\" id=\"msgs\"></div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"thinking\" id=\"thinking\">Agent processing...</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"input-line\">\n        <span class=\"input-prompt\">❯</span>\n        <input type=\"text\" class=\"chat-input\" id=\"inp\" placeholder=\"Input sequence...\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n// =========================================================================\n// WEBGL2 CONTROL ROOM PHYSICS — Instanced rendering (100k nodes)\n// Palette: Slate, Steel, Cyan accent\n// =========================================================================\nconst canvas = document.getElementById('glcanvas');\nconst gl = canvas.getContext('webgl2', { antialias: true, alpha: false });\nif (!gl) document.body.innerHTML = 'WebGL2 required';\n\nlet W, H;\nfunction resize() {\n    W = window.innerWidth; H = window.innerHeight;\n    canvas.width = W * 2; canvas.height = H * 2;\n    canvas.style.width = W + 'px'; canvas.style.height = H + 'px';\n    gl.viewport(0, 0, W*2, H*2);\n}\nwindow.addEventListener('resize', resize); resize();\n\nfunction compile(src, type) {\n    const s = gl.createShader(type); gl.shaderSource(s, src); gl.compileShader(s);\n    if (!gl.getShaderParameter(s, gl.COMPILE_STATUS)) console.error(gl.getShaderInfoLog(s));\n    return s;\n}\nfunction prog(vs, fs) {\n    const p = gl.createProgram(); gl.attachShader(p, compile(vs, gl.VERTEX_SHADER)); gl.attachShader(p, compile(fs, gl.FRAGMENT_SHADER)); gl.linkProgram(p);\n    return p;\n}\n\n// 1. Instanced Background Field Shader (100,000 tiny spheres)\nconst instVS = `#version 300 es\nin vec2 aPos;\nin vec3 aOffset; // x, y, phase\nuniform float uTime;\nuniform float uAspect;\nuniform float uPulse;\nout vec2 vUV;\nout float vBright;\nvoid main() {\n    vUV = aPos;\n    float phase = aOffset.z;\n    \n    // Complex organic drift\n    vec2 pos = aOffset.xy;\n    pos.x += sin(uTime * 0.1 + phase) * 0.1;\n    pos.y += cos(uTime * 0.08 + phase * 1.5) * 0.1;\n    \n    // Parallax & scale variation\n    float depth = 1.0 + sin(phase * 123.0) * 0.5;\n    float scale = 0.0025 * depth;\n    \n    // React to global agent activity pulse\n    float wave = sin(pos.x * 5.0 + pos.y * 5.0 - uTime * 2.0);\n    vBright = (0.2 + (sin(uTime + phase * 10.0) * 0.5 + 0.5) * 0.3) * (1.0 + wave * uPulse * 2.0);\n    \n    gl_Position = vec4(pos + aPos * scale * vec2(1.0/uAspect, 1.0), 0.0, 1.0);\n}`;\nconst instFS = `#version 300 es\nprecision highp float;\nin vec2 vUV;\nin float vBright;\nout vec4 outColor;\nvoid main() {\n    float d = length(vUV);\n    if (d > 1.0) discard; // Perfect sphere cutout\n    \n    float core = smoothstep(1.0, 0.4, d);\n    // Slate/steel base with cyan accent when bright\n    vec3 steel = vec3(0.3, 0.35, 0.4);\n    vec3 accent = vec3(0.0, 0.9, 1.0);\n    vec3 col = mix(steel, accent, vBright * 0.5) * vBright * core;\n    \n    outColor = vec4(col, core * vBright);\n}`;\n\n// 2. Main Agent Orbs Shader\nconst orbVS = `#version 300 es\nin vec2 aPos;\nuniform vec2 uCenter;\nuniform float uRadius;\nuniform float uAspect;\nout vec2 vUV;\nvoid main() {\n    vUV = aPos;\n    gl_Position = vec4(uCenter + aPos * uRadius * vec2(1.0/uAspect, 1.0), 0.0, 1.0);\n}`;\nconst orbFS = `#version 300 es\nprecision highp float;\nin vec2 vUV;\nuniform vec3 uColor;\nuniform float uGlow;\nuniform float uTime;\nout vec4 outColor;\nvoid main() {\n    float d = length(vUV);\n    float core = smoothstep(0.2, 0.15, d);\n    float halo = exp(-d * 4.0) * 0.5;\n    \n    // Minimalist clinical glow (less smoke, more precision)\n    float pulse = 1.0 + sin(uTime * 3.0) * 0.1;\n    float i = (core + halo) * uGlow * pulse;\n    \n    vec3 col = mix(vec3(0.9,0.9,1.0), uColor, 0.7) * i;\n    col += vec3(1.0) * core * 0.5 * uGlow;\n    \n    outColor = vec4(col, i);\n}`;\n\nconst pInst = prog(instVS, instFS);\nconst pOrb = prog(orbVS, orbFS);\n\n// Geometry (Quad)\nconst quadData = new Float32Array([-1,-1, 1,-1, -1,1, 1,1]);\nconst quadBuf = gl.createBuffer();\ngl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, quadBuf);\ngl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, quadData, gl.STATIC_DRAW);\n\n// 100,000 Instanced Nodes\nconst INST_COUNT = 100000;\nconst instData = new Float32Array(INST_COUNT * 3); // x, y, phase\nfor(let i=0; i<INST_COUNT; i++) {\n    instData[i*3 + 0] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 4.0; // wider spread\n    instData[i*3 + 1] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 2.5;\n    instData[i*3 + 2] = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;\n}\nconst instBuf = gl.createBuffer();\ngl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, instBuf);\ngl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, instData, gl.STATIC_DRAW);\n\n// Agents Setup\nconst AGENTS = [\n    { id:'maxx',  name:'MAXX',  col:[0.0, 0.9, 1.0], x:0, y:0, a:0, r:0.25, g:1, lb:Date.now() }, // Accent cyan\n    { id:'vance', name:'VANCE', col:[0.5, 0.55, 0.6], x:0, y:0, a:2, r:0.25, g:1, lb:Date.now() }, // Steel\n    { id:'eden',  name:'EDEN',  col:[0.6, 0.65, 0.7], x:0, y:0, a:4, r:0.25, g:1, lb:Date.now() }, // Slate\n    { id:'daxx',  name:'DAXX',  col:[0.4, 0.45, 0.5], x:0, y:0, a:6, r:0.25, g:1, lb:Date.now() }  // Dark steel\n];\n\nconst sb = document.getElementById('statusBar');\nAGENTS.forEach(a => {\n    const d = document.createElement('div'); d.className='agent-metric'; d.id='m-'+a.id;\n    d.innerHTML = `<span class=\"indicator\">●</span> ${a.name}`;\n    sb.appendChild(d);\n});\n\nlet t0 = performance.now()/1000, globalPulse = 0.0;\nfunction draw() {\n    requestAnimationFrame(draw);\n    const t = performance.now()/1000 - t0;\n    \n    gl.clearColor(0.023, 0.023, 0.031, 1); // #060608 bg\n    gl.clear(gl.COLOR_BUFFER_BIT);\n    gl.enable(gl.BLEND); gl.blendFunc(gl.SRC_ALPHA, gl.ONE);\n    \n    // Calc aggregate activity for field pulse\n    let activeAgents = 0;\n    AGENTS.forEach((a, i) => {\n        a.a += 0.005; // Slow deliberate orbit\n        const act = Math.max(0.1, 1 - (Date.now()-a.lb)/60000);\n        a.g = 0.2 + act * 0.8;\n        if(act > 0.5) activeAgents++;\n        \n        a.x = Math.cos(a.a) * a.r;\n        a.y = Math.sin(a.a) * a.r;\n        \n        const mel = document.getElementById('m-'+a.id);\n        if(mel) mel.className = 'agent-metric ' + (act > 0.5 ? 'active' : '');\n    });\n    \n    globalPulse += (activeAgents > 0 ? 1.0 : 0.0 - globalPulse) * 0.05;\n\n    // Draw 100k Instanced Field\n    gl.useProgram(pInst);\n    gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, quadBuf);\n    const ip = gl.getAttribLocation(pInst, 'aPos');\n    gl.enableVertexAttribArray(ip); gl.vertexAttribPointer(ip, 2, gl.FLOAT, false, 0, 0);\n    \n    gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, instBuf);\n    const io = gl.getAttribLocation(pInst, 'aOffset');\n    gl.enableVertexAttribArray(io); gl.vertexAttribPointer(io, 3, gl.FLOAT, false, 0, 0);\n    gl.vertexAttribDivisor(io, 1); // WebGL2 instancing\n    \n    gl.uniform1f(gl.getUniformLocation(pInst, 'uTime'), t);\n    gl.uniform1f(gl.getUniformLocation(pInst, 'uAspect'), W/H);\n    gl.uniform1f(gl.getUniformLocation(pInst, 'uPulse'), globalPulse);\n    \n    gl.drawArraysInstanced(gl.TRIANGLE_STRIP, 0, 4, INST_COUNT);\n    gl.vertexAttribDivisor(io, 0); // Reset\n    \n    // Draw Core Agent Orbs\n    gl.useProgram(pOrb);\n    gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, quadBuf);\n    const op = gl.getAttribLocation(pOrb, 'aPos');\n    gl.enableVertexAttribArray(op); gl.vertexAttribPointer(op, 2, gl.FLOAT, false, 0, 0);\n    \n    AGENTS.forEach(a => {\n        gl.uniform2f(gl.getUniformLocation(pOrb, 'uCenter'), a.x, a.y);\n        gl.uniform1f(gl.getUniformLocation(pOrb, 'uRadius'), 0.25); // Smaller, precise\n        gl.uniform1f(gl.getUniformLocation(pOrb, 'uAspect'), W/H);\n        gl.uniform3fv(gl.getUniformLocation(pOrb, 'uColor'), a.col);\n        gl.uniform1f(gl.getUniformLocation(pOrb, 'uGlow'), a.g);\n        gl.uniform1f(gl.getUniformLocation(pOrb, 'uTime'), t);\n        gl.drawArrays(gl.TRIANGLE_STRIP, 0, 4);\n    });\n}\ndraw();\n\n// =========================================================================\n// CHAT & TELEMETRY LOGIC\n// =========================================================================\nconst msgsEl = document.getElementById('msgs');\nconst inp = document.getElementById('inp');\nlet lastLen = 0;\n\nfunction appendMsg(sender, text) {\n    const d = document.createElement('div');\n    d.className = 'msg ' + (sender === 'user' ? 'user' : 'agent');\n    \n    let name = sender;\n    if (sender === 'user') name = 'SYS';\n    else {\n        const ag = AGENTS.find(x => x.id === sender.toLowerCase());\n        if (ag) { name = ag.name; ag.lb = Date.now(); }\n        else name = sender.toUpperCase();\n    }\n\n    d.innerHTML = `\n        <div class=\"msg-sender\">${name}</div>\n        <div class=\"msg-content\">${text.replace(/</g,'&lt;')}</div>\n    `;\n    msgsEl.appendChild(d);\n    msgsEl.parentElement.scrollTop = msgsEl.parentElement.scrollHeight;\n}\n\ninp.onkeydown = async (e) => {\n    if(e.key === 'Enter' && inp.value.trim()) {\n        const v = inp.value.trim();\n        inp.value = '';\n        try {\n            await fetch('/api/chat', {\n                method:'POST',\n                headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},\n                body:JSON.stringify({sender:'user', text:v})\n            });\n        } catch(err) {}\n    }\n};\n\nsetInterval(async () => {\n    try {\n        const r = await fetch('/api/chat_history');\n        if(r.ok) {\n            const arr = await r.json();\n            if(arr.length > lastLen) {\n                for(let i=lastLen; i<arr.length; i++) appendMsg(arr[i].sender, arr[i].text);\n                lastLen = arr.length;\n            }\n        }\n    } catch(e) {}\n}, 1000);\n</script>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n\"\"\"\n\nwith open('/Users/ajoxendine68/Desktop/SSOT_Agentic_Brain/ops/scripts/fullscreen_ui/sovereign_orbs.html', 'w') as f:\n    f.write(HTML)\nEOF\npython3 /tmp/write_orbs_v3.py","Cwd":"/Users/ajoxendine68/Desktop/SSOT_Agentic_Brain","RequestedTerminalID":"","RunPersistent":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Rewriting WebGL engine with 100k instances","toolSummary":"Write 100k instances WebGL2 code"}}]}
