{"step_index":3711,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-29T10:34:19Z","thinking":"**Generating Node Structures**\n\nI've just finished generating `ast_nodes.json`, a file containing exactly 100,000 nodes. The initial 4,178 nodes represent actual files within the `SSOT_Agentic_Brain` repository, arranged in a deterministic golden ratio spiral (Vogel spiral) layout to create a structured disk, with their scale determined by the file's size.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"cat << 'EOF' > /tmp/update_orbs_ast.py\nimport re\n\npath = '/Users/ajoxendine68/Desktop/SSOT_Agentic_Brain/ops/scripts/fullscreen_ui/sovereign_orbs.html'\nwith open(path, 'r') as f:\n    content = f.read()\n\n# Update the Vertex Shader for the instanced field to support scale and color\nnew_instVS = \"\"\"#version 300 es\nin vec2 aPos;\nin vec4 aOffsetScale; // x, y, scale, phase\nin vec3 aColor;       // r, g, b\nuniform float uTime;\nuniform float uAspect;\nuniform float uPulse;\nout vec2 vUV;\nout float vBright;\nout vec3 vColor;\nvoid main() {\n    vUV = aPos;\n    float phase = aOffsetScale.w;\n    float scale = aOffsetScale.z * 0.003;\n    vColor = aColor;\n    \n    // Slow structural rotation\n    float s = sin(uTime * 0.02);\n    float c = cos(uTime * 0.02);\n    vec2 pos = vec2(\n        aOffsetScale.x * c - aOffsetScale.y * s,\n        aOffsetScale.x * s + aOffsetScale.y * c\n    );\n    \n    // Z-depth pulsing\n    float wave = sin(length(pos)*2.0 - uTime);\n    vBright = (0.3 + (sin(uTime + phase) * 0.5 + 0.5) * 0.4) * (1.0 + wave * uPulse * 2.0);\n    \n    gl_Position = vec4(pos + aPos * scale * vec2(1.0/uAspect, 1.0), 0.0, 1.0);\n}\"\"\"\ncontent = re.sub(r\"const instVS = `#version 300 es.*?}`;\", f\"const instVS = `{new_instVS}`;\", content, flags=re.DOTALL)\n\nnew_instFS = \"\"\"#version 300 es\nprecision highp float;\nin vec2 vUV;\nin float vBright;\nin vec3 vColor;\nout vec4 outColor;\nvoid main() {\n    float d = length(vUV);\n    if (d > 1.0) discard;\n    float core = smoothstep(1.0, 0.4, d);\n    outColor = vec4(vColor * vBright * core, core * vBright);\n}\"\"\"\ncontent = re.sub(r\"const instFS = `#version 300 es.*?}`;\", f\"const instFS = `{new_instFS}`;\", content, flags=re.DOTALL)\n\n# Replace the Math.random() initialization with a fetch of ast_nodes.json\nnew_init = \"\"\"// Load Real Codebase AST Nodes\nconst INST_COUNT = 100000;\nlet instData = new Float32Array(INST_COUNT * 4); // x, y, scale, phase\nlet colorData = new Float32Array(INST_COUNT * 3); // r, g, b\nconst instBuf = gl.createBuffer();\nconst colorBuf = gl.createBuffer();\n\nfetch('ast_nodes.json').then(r => r.json()).then(data => {\n    for(let i=0; i<data.nodes.length; i++) {\n        let n = data.nodes[i];\n        instData[i*4+0] = n.x;\n        instData[i*4+1] = n.y;\n        instData[i*4+2] = n.scale;\n        instData[i*4+3] = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;\n        colorData[i*3+0] = n.r;\n        colorData[i*3+1] = n.g;\n        colorData[i*3+2] = n.b;\n    }\n    gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, instBuf);\n    gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, instData, gl.STATIC_DRAW);\n    gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, colorBuf);\n    gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, colorData, gl.STATIC_DRAW);\n});\"\"\"\n\ncontent = re.sub(r\"// 100,000 Instanced Nodes.*?gl\\.bufferData\\(gl\\.ARRAY_BUFFER, instData, gl\\.STATIC_DRAW\\);\", new_init, content, flags=re.DOTALL)\n\n# Update draw loop to bind the new buffers\nnew_draw = \"\"\"\n    // Draw 100k Instanced Field\n    gl.useProgram(pInst);\n    gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, quadBuf);\n    const ip = gl.getAttribLocation(pInst, 'aPos');\n    gl.enableVertexAttribArray(ip); gl.vertexAttribPointer(ip, 2, gl.FLOAT, false, 0, 0);\n    \n    gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, instBuf);\n    const io = gl.getAttribLocation(pInst, 'aOffsetScale');\n    if (io >= 0) { gl.enableVertexAttribArray(io); gl.vertexAttribPointer(io, 4, gl.FLOAT, false, 0, 0); gl.vertexAttribDivisor(io, 1); }\n    \n    gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, colorBuf);\n    const ic = gl.getAttribLocation(pInst, 'aColor');\n    if (ic >= 0) { gl.enableVertexAttribArray(ic); gl.vertexAttribPointer(ic, 3, gl.FLOAT, false, 0, 0); gl.vertexAttribDivisor(ic, 1); }\n    \n    gl.uniform1f(gl.getUniformLocation(pInst, 'uTime'), t);\n    gl.uniform1f(gl.getUniformLocation(pInst, 'uAspect'), W/H);\n    gl.uniform1f(gl.getUniformLocation(pInst, 'uPulse'), globalPulse);\n    \n    gl.drawArraysInstanced(gl.TRIANGLE_STRIP, 0, 4, INST_COUNT);\n    if (io >= 0) gl.vertexAttribDivisor(io, 0);\n    if (ic >= 0) gl.vertexAttribDivisor(ic, 0);\n\"\"\"\ncontent = re.sub(r\"// Draw 100k Instanced Field.*?gl\\.vertexAttribDivisor\\(io, 0\\); // Reset\", new_draw, content, flags=re.DOTALL)\n\nwith open(path, 'w') as f:\n    f.write(content)\nEOF\npython3 /tmp/update_orbs_ast.py","Cwd":"/Users/ajoxendine68/Desktop/SSOT_Agentic_Brain","RequestedTerminalID":"","RunPersistent":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Injecting AST data into WebGL","toolSummary":"Wire real codebase data to WebGL"}}]}
